    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seized by criminals, the island designated for your research needs your help. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Yatziri and the Wazhari tribe to liberate their hostages, explore hidden secrets, craft essential items and weapons, and strategically use fire and water in challenging puzzles and life-or-death battles for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a fully open-world island, offering boundless exploration opportunities.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic 24-hour day/night cycle and diverse weather conditions such as rain and snow, actively influencing your in-game experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Employ your versatile crossbow in various modes, including standard, electric, explosive, and flammable options.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the island\u2019s creatures: free the wild tigers from their cages and lure them with food to do your dirty work. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find essential items, trade them with the tribe, or get them from looting fallen enemies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources to craft a variety of objects and weapons crucial for your journey.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elements like fire and water can be used to unravel puzzles, liberate hostages, and unveil hidden secrets.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter advanced AI that dynamically reacts to your in-game actions, random events, and changing weather conditions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in realistic physics and graphics, incorporating the latest Unity High Definition Rendering Pipeline (HDRP).</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seized by criminals, the island designated for your research needs your help. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Yatziri and the Wazhari tribe to liberate their hostages, explore hidden secrets, craft essential items and weapons, and strategically use fire and water in challenging puzzles and life-or-death battles for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a fully open-world island, offering boundless exploration opportunities.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic 24-hour day/night cycle and diverse weather conditions such as rain and snow, actively influencing your in-game experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Employ your versatile crossbow in various modes, including standard, electric, explosive, and flammable options.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the island\u2019s creatures: free the wild tigers from their cages and lure them with food to do your dirty work. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find essential items, trade them with the tribe, or get them from looting fallen enemies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources to craft a variety of objects and weapons crucial for your journey.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elements like fire and water can be used to unravel puzzles, liberate hostages, and unveil hidden secrets.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter advanced AI that dynamically reacts to your in-game actions, random events, and changing weather conditions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in realistic physics and graphics, incorporating the latest Unity High Definition Rendering Pipeline (HDRP).</p></li></ul>",
